 "stimulus_html": "Four time series models were produced to model a given dataset. Various measures of error were run on each of the models, the results of which are shown in the table. <table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td></td>\n<td align=\"right\"><b>MAE</b></td>\n<td align=\"right\"><b>RMSE</b></td>\n<td align=\"right\"><b>MAPE</b></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">Model 1</td>\n<td align=\"right\">103.1</td>\n<td align=\"right\">131.2</td>\n<td align=\"right\">0.097</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">Model 2</td>\n<td align=\"right\">251.7</td>\n<td align=\"right\">207.9</td>\n<td align=\"right\">0.136</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">Model 3</td>\n<td align=\"right\">110.7</td>\n<td align=\"right\">129.0</td>\n<td align=\"right\">0.115</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">Model 4</td>\n<td align=\"right\">89.8</td>\n<td align=\"right\">125.3</td>\n<td align=\"right\">0.191</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody><caption>Measures of Error</caption>\n</table>\n",
